I arrive at the office.
It is half past eight.
My colleague Jonas is already there.
He is sitting at his desk.
He sees me and smiles.
"Good morning, Maya!" he says.
"Good morning, Jonas," I answer.
"How are you?" he asks.
"I am doing well, thanks," I say.
"The weather today is really beautiful."
"Yes, the sun is finally shining!" Jonas says.
"Spring in Berlin is great."
I walk to my desk.
I sit down.
I open my backpack.
I take my laptop out of the backpack.
I put the laptop on the table.
I turn the laptop on.
My workday begins.
I read my emails.
